      "principles": [
       "PRINCIPLE_RETRIEVAL_PRACTICE"
      ],
      "rationale": "Each small data set has exactly one mode and a whole-number mean. The student orders the data in the space before finding the median. Finding all four measures for one set shows they can be different.",
